{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ff08549164dc6e1eefd6810418af20f999fea75886bbbd9de01e51e42e5b7f0a", "ja": "妖精たちの夜", "zh": "妖精们的夜晚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f39150eb6217d61e866dec5628dde6f3c1787b74b9d5698ddc0013527977a967", "ja": "大盛況のうちに終わったFairy公演。\nこの公演で絆を深めた静香達は、\n次に向けてのヤル気も充分。\nでもその前に、楽しい反省会！　と、\nワイワイ計画を立て始めるのだった。", "zh": "Fairy公演在一片盛况中落幕。\n经过这场公演后，静香等人的情谊更加深厚，\n她们面对下一场公演也干劲十足。\n但在那之前要开一场快乐的反省会！\n于是大家热热闹闹地开始计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "c636a68cfba645f3900586854453d1c6b608f73759b4aa6e3dd2e5f11b101fd8", "ja": "ん～、気持ちよかった～♪　みんな、お疲れさま！\nいや～、楽しかったね！", "zh": "嗯～真畅快～♪大家辛苦了！\n哎呀～真开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7c677c87e43c70e42bcde25debfa70bb8e152507c76af11bffe597dcd206f5fe", "ja": "はい、充実した時間をすごすことができました。\nお客さま方と、心が繋がったようにも思えて……。", "zh": "是的，我们度过了非常充实的时光。\n感觉心灵也和观众系在一起了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "64d15fa906f90a5f086324974d76c76b053e4bcfbe53ee00a54cdad156b4eb1d", "ja": "でも、あっという間でしたね。\n気がついたら終わっていた感じです。", "zh": "但一转眼就过去了呢。\n感觉回过神来就结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5154bbffb0aaf4b37046a87c4d7900223138779569e79dcb4d3ea4e5bce0ebd9", "ja": "それだけステージに集中してたってことだな。\nみんな、いい公演だったぞ！", "zh": "这代表你们非常专注在表演上啊，\n各位，这是场精彩的公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "b47c83e0b77cb596fb02248b44221e06c9a3ed3bcd2cd6cb038c3733730125d7", "ja": "シズ、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "静，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "534c3ccaa79c2460346e668ba10ee0d663ef55f4477be8feaae56a58a9c2c598", "ja": "あ……いえ。\nライブの熱がなかなか抜けなくて……。", "zh": "啊……没事，\n我还沉浸在演唱会的热烈气氛中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "7c9c6f8219bc83088df9689b9dab00ad3c165ed4a4b09ac57f64a7e979f94f18", "ja": "そういえば……静香、最後の挨拶の時に\n泣きそうになってたわね。", "zh": "这么说来……\n静香在最后打招呼的时候快哭出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "6fe2961bfd56295d05968d3564508b75ed32adf08ccaf88b699770e10c2418e6", "ja": "そ、そんなことは……！\nちょっとだけよ、ちょっとだけ。", "zh": "那、那个是……！\n只有一点点而已喔，一点点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "b22f586bf4d69802264c3137f405f3dcf1040834f30b9b8902a114ccc99503f5", "ja": "な、なんですか、{$P$}。\nもう、こっち見ないでください。", "zh": "怎、怎么了吗，{$P$}？\n真是的，请不要再看我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b7696e48b9357ce2e0b4bbb512e58c6f005778201f28cf735d27229265365916", "ja": "いや、別に何も言ってないだろう……。\nとにかくみんな、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "不，我什么都没说吧……\n总之大家都努力了一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "2a4ef9842668b3da51ae9e0c1fcd49edd4066809ae9ef47f2e8e4fbbde37c4d5", "ja": "ああ、ほかのFairyメンバーのステージも、\n最高にアツかった！", "zh": "是啊，其他Fairy成员的表演\n也非常热烈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9cdd2020d14e75f5cd8dee7a4e8db2a7509ad8c7d06dc95a552a97418073860", "ja": "うんうんっ。歩のダンスも、ロコのアートも\nすごかったよね～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，步的舞蹈和ROCO的Art\n都很厉害呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "af24c8d0fb1425f5017f0082f7b5b3dec42e358bd81b6261a6bf55c6b107e152", "ja": "桃子のダンスも、レッスンの時より\nずっとよかったかも……。", "zh": "桃子的舞蹈似乎也比训练课程时\n进步很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0abf0f9445820f6b2101e7c9bcf334dab9a3f34c31503276555ae3092fa5711", "ja": "チームの中で、お互いに高めあう……。\nそういうことが、できたと思います。", "zh": "分队的成员互相切磋成长……\n我想你们做到了这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "cb16dfeea99737a122209fb907750950226a0a231527c7485e72e9c38eed324a", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。\nPrincessとAngelの公演もするんだよね？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}，\nPrincess和Angel也要举行公演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f225df137e4eac5cbdb37d5a15cb370d644d30f268fe61a456133c11a700f2de", "ja": "もちろん。今日のFairy公演を見て、自分達も早く\nステージに立ちたいと思ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "当然，看了今天的Fairy公演，\n她们应该也想早点站上舞台吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "af7ee8572a401b5e59221973e2256212b30e5f1576d166ec270d1c8f048784ef", "ja": "へぇ、そいつはいいね。\n今度はチーム同士の競争ってワケだ。", "zh": "哦，这还真不错。\n接下来就变成分队之间的竞争了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "d68fb952bed8a310255c8e1435571f4d30aa8c81412bb6450cf402c37e700414", "ja": "Fairyとして、ウチらも負けないように\n頑張らないとな！", "zh": "身为Fairy，我们也要好好加油，\n不能输给她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "d9107f831ba5714b721fac21961748b2a4701786d1a1ee45c42a7e4be3e2ccf5", "ja": "だよね～。だって今日の公演はスタートだって、\n{$P$}も言ってたし♪", "zh": "对啊～毕竟{$P$}也说了，\n今天的公演只是开始嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f52edc101824a5f58017a906960c88cf42bf549131e39a3feee0dad65e37308c", "ja": "そうだな。まだまだ、始まったばかりだ！", "zh": "是啊，现在才刚要开始而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "c9d91f904fa253644b5b35dc281b00f0062fafec1a760f8bfa75c98ca949934d", "ja": "じゃあ、今後のためにも。まずはみんなで、\n反省会をしなくちゃいけませんね。", "zh": "那为了往后发展，\n大家要先开场反省会才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "6c42b5628f6b77cbfae5dc6cea00a22ee4660e176ea7c3772559bb061b78c1a8", "ja": "反省会かぁ。どうせなら、\n楽しくできるのがいいな～。", "zh": "反省会啊～既然都要办，\n还是开心一点的好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "73c85bb0bcc114733a92bdc8650ae51407b74296b319ae600686c9ff1bb4d0fa", "ja": "そうだっ、Fairyのみんなでどっか行こうよ～！\n旅行とか、ショッピングとか♪", "zh": "对了，Fairy的成员大家一起出去玩吧～！\n像是旅行或逛街♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4e1807a5c92513e5a9e1d6d613a993196c68f4b013ee165e0e84c58b08cd8682", "ja": "……それは反省会なのか？", "zh": "……那算是反省会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "099d4d650f18f3b3938033a7105f5e34eea1b72b567bf611370f3c9037b052a2", "ja": "あはは、細かいことは気にすんなって！\nあんたも一緒に楽しめばいいだろ♪", "zh": "哈哈，别介意这种细节啦！\n你也一起去玩不就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "de6df1dd58c7432bf37a5d24dcaa9aa2dd230fe2bfbe91401faf75250220d76a", "ja": "はっ。まさか、\n私達と出かけるのが嫌なのですか？", "zh": "啊，该不会，\n你不想和我们一起出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "58bbcdb9b20231892dd35e17a267f895c5f4d2a1a362c9a308a5206c97cf9bd1", "ja": "ち、違う違う！\nわかったよ、ちょっと計画を立ててみるよ。", "zh": "不、不是不是！\n知道了啦，我会稍微计划一下的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b4474f211e441592804d40f2490017059f8864b05eeb47534deedba40361eda", "ja": "さっすが{$P$}♪\nごちそうさま～！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}♪\n谢谢招待～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "eab6ea2bc707ec1465e4e467ac1b42486a873a2fe3e0250b14464c416bb148d5", "ja": "ごちそうさまです。", "zh": "谢谢招待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "65031f1cae2b1439e42f8f9d5752131b07641e52ccfc2a979cafa6d53a01f5f0", "ja": "ごちそうさん♪", "zh": "谢谢招待啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "eab6ea2bc707ec1465e4e467ac1b42486a873a2fe3e0250b14464c416bb148d5", "ja": "ごちそうさまです。", "zh": "感谢招待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a575466fe143fb9fd4a28dafe364ef99ab0234f81fe12a263a9f388835e07d97", "ja": "（くっ、こんな時まで息ぴったりとは……。\nまあ、これも公演の成果と言えなくもないか）", "zh": "（呜，没想到连这种时候都默契绝佳……\n算了，这也可说是公演的成果吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "c704b7cb6a55c984977492fa3e37c45b79677bbdc400c2a2408497096327154a", "ja": "（Fairyチームの結束は、充分に高まった。\n妖精たちの、これからの輝きに期待しよう！）", "zh": "（Fairy队的团结精神已经充分提升，\n继续期待妖精们未来散发的光芒吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
